        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-counters-p09-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "屋子: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "一屋子 + noun uses a room as a container measure. It means a roomful, not one unit of the following thing.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这里有一屋子人。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ yǒu yī wūzi rén 。",
                "meaning": "There is a roomful of people here.",
                "audio": "bc3a5a7817df7af129e9309bb75a583a36e5494f8ee8a18b6d376f7c7a20b14b"
              },
              {
                "text": "他买了一屋子书。",
                "pinyin": "tā mǎi le yī wūzi shū 。",
                "meaning": "He bought a roomful of books.",
                "audio": "046fa79ce0f4a3da5db894987afe0f1640413a61ef778584403352972deb69e5"
              }
            ]
          },
